<SECTION image-layout="blank" background-color="#1A1A1A">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H1><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Market Momentum Accelerates Across Four Key Sectors</SPAN></H1>
    <COLUMNS colWidths="[50,50]">
      <DIV>
        <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Commercial viability convergence drives unprecedented deployment velocity across energy storage, carbon capture, alternative fuels, and grid infrastructure. Manufacturing scale effects compound with technology maturation to create self-reinforcing adoption cycles. Supply chain constraints and regulatory uncertainty remain primary deployment risks, but market fundamentals support continued exponential growth through 2027.</SPAN></P>
      </DIV>
      <DIV>
        <SMART-LAYOUT variant="outlineBoxes" cellSize="15">
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#00D4FF">Energy Storage</SPAN></B></H4>
            <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Battery costs collapse while grid integration demands triple, creating massive deployment opportunity</SPAN></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#00FF88">Carbon Capture</SPAN></B></H4>
            <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Direct air capture and industrial point-source technologies achieve commercial economics</SPAN></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#00D4FF">Alternative Fuels</SPAN></B></H4>
            <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Green hydrogen and sustainable aviation fuels reach cost parity with fossil alternatives</SPAN></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
          <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
            <H4><B><SPAN text-color="#00FF88">Grid Infrastructure</SPAN></B></H4>
            <P><SPAN text-color="#FFFFFF">Smart grid and transmission technologies enable renewable energy integration at scale</SPAN></P>
          </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        </SMART-LAYOUT>
      </DIV>
    </COLUMNS>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>